    "faq.a1": "Session Sniffer is 100% external — it only reads network traffic passively using standard system capture drivers and never injects into or modifies game files or memory. There is zero risk of an anti-cheat ban, and all source code is open for anyone to inspect on GitHub under GPLv3.",
