    "history.title": "The Complete History of Session Sniffer",
    "history.v_1_0_0": "Initial Python console release of GTA V Session Sniffer tracking connected & disconnected players, First/Last Seen timestamps, packet counters, ports, and country lookup.",
    "history.v_1_0_4": "Updated third-party Python libraries and introduced the MaxMind GeoLite2 reader architecture across v1.0.4 – v1.0.6.",
    "history.v_1_1_0": "Added automatic MaxMind GeoLite2 database downloads & updates, LAN ARP scanning, and customizable field sorting & PPS timers.",
    "history.v_1_1_6": "Added Mobile, VPN/Proxy, and Hosting detection columns, Rejoins counter, 1,500 IPs/min batch IP-API lookups, and Session Host crown detection (v1.1.6 – v1.1.9).",
    "history.v_1_2_0": "Refined color-coded console tables, added Discord Rich Presence, and expanded verified compatibility across PC, PS3, PS5, and Xbox One (v1.2.0 – v1.2.9).",
    "history.v_1_3_0": "Landmark PyQt6 + QDarkStyle desktop GUI rewrite and official rename to \"Session Sniffer\", adding right-click context menus, UserIP colors, and multi-cell selection/copy.",
    "history.v_1_3_3": "Shipped standalone PyInstaller .exe builds with bundled TShark/Npcap, ICMP/TCP/spoofed Ping actions, Pinging column, and accelerated reverse-DNS resolution (v1.3.3 – v1.3.6).",
    "history.v_1_3_7": "Added automatic date-based build version numbers, improved network interface discovery, and fixed broadcast/multicast filtering (v1.3.7 – v1.3.7post6).",
    "history.v_1_3_8": "Switched MAC vendor lookup to the Wireshark manuf database, improved global PPS calculations, and added toolbar quick-links (v1.3.8 – v1.3.8.post2).",
    "history.v_1_3_9": "Introduced live detection warnings for Mobile, VPN, and Hosting connections alongside GUI notification toggle controls.",
    "history.v_1_4_0": "Added collapsible Connected/Disconnected tables with live player counts, improved minimized-table performance, and hardened Session Host IP handling.",
    "history.v_1_4_1": "Major core code reorganization splitting monolithic capture, lookup, and rendering logic into cleaner modules.",
    "history.v_1_4_2": "Improved ARP spoofing error diagnostics, strict IP/port validation, consolidated exceptions, and stabilized TShark capture lifecycles (v1.4.2 – v1.4.2.post5).",
    "history.v_1_4_3": "Added Bandwidth metrics, hideable packet columns, modular theme colors, Jane/Liam voice notifications, and improved structured logging (v1.4.3 – v1.4.3.post4).",
    "history.v_1_5_0": "2,100+ commits & 115 test builds: complete modular rewrite, modern PySide6 desktop UI, native packet capture (no TShark needed), Windows/Linux/macOS apps, RDR2 toolkit, Looky System, Live Graphs, Combo Rules, Local Web Dashboard + QR Code, Hotspot Manager, Port Scanner, 6 Themes + Theme Manager, and 33 languages with right-to-left support.",
    "history.v_pc": "Windows PC companion script detecting blacklisted IPs in GTA V and Minecraft Bedrock Edition using TShark/Npcap and a customizable Settings.ini.",
    "history.v_ps3": "Origin Windows Batch + TShark script created to warn against DDoSers, IP booters, and mod-menu crashers on PS3; live PSN username detection, Blacklist.ini, and Windows & webMAN MOD alerts across 25 versions (v1.0 → v2.2.4).",
    "history.view_tag": "GitHub",
